================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
================================================================================

Boreas has zero runtime dependencies. It uses only frameworks provided by
Apple as part of macOS and the Xcode SDK.

If a third-party dependency is ever added, it must be listed here with:
  - project name
  - version
  - license (MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0 or ISC only)
  - source URL
  - what it is used for

GPL, LGPL, AGPL and SSPL licensed code must never be included. This is
enforced by the `gate-deps` check.

Currently: none.

================================================================================
DEVELOPMENT TOOLS
================================================================================

The following tools are used during development only. They are not distributed
with the application and are not linked into it.

  XcodeGen      - MIT      - generates the Xcode project from project.yml
  SwiftLint     - MIT      - Swift style and convention enforcement
  swift-format  - Apache-2.0 - Swift source formatting

